# Key paths that scripts/leak-scan skips. Key paths only, never values.
# Only generic skill vocabulary belongs here. Personal values (products,
# shoes, names, IDs, weights, zones, dates, races) must never be listed.
# Plan key paths start with "plan", not the plan id.
# Format: `<key path>  sha256:<first 16 hex of sha256(trimmed value)>`.
# The pin ties each entry to its value: if the YAML is reordered or the value
# changes, the entry stops matching and the key is scanned again. Get the line
# with `scripts/leak-scan --pin <key path>`. Never pin a personal value: short
# values can be brute-forced from the pin.

